OL,3,GNEWSALetby 'boyfriend' doctor named as
OL,4,Acourt order lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe doctor described during Lucy
OL,7,FLetby's trial as her "boyfriend" can
OL,8,Fnow be identified.
OL,10,FMark Deakin, who died in July aged 53,
OL,11,Fhad been protected by a court anonymity
OL,12,Forder that has now been lifted.
OL,14,FDeakin worked alongside Letby, now 36,
OL,15,Fat the Countess of Chester Hospital
OL,16,Fduring the period in which she murdered
OL,17,Fseven babies and attempted to murder
OL,18,Fsix others in 2015 and 2016.
